the bearer role is addresser.


norm e idas art 2 1 scope is identified by "http://example.org/Rule_eIDAS_Art2_1_Scope".

norm e idas art 2 1 scope is a scope rule.

norm e idas art 2 1 scope has the label "Regulation (EU) No 910/2014 (eIDAS) Article 2(1): Scope".

norm e idas art 2 1 scope has the legal text "This Regulation applies to electronic identification schemes that have been notified by a Member State, and to trust service providers that are established in the Union.".

norm e idas art 2 1 scope is established in "http://data.europa.eu/eli/reg/2014/910/art_2/par_1".


